// Wall cube half-extent = half of spacing(), so wall cubes tile seamlessly
// with no gap and no overlap. eye_y is the camera's fixed height (dead
// center of the wall cubes' vertical extent -- there's no floor/ceiling
// distinction, see the README's rough edges). move_speed is milli-units of
// travel per movement key event (WASD).
wall_half() {
} return int 1000;

eye_y() {
} return int 0;

move_speed() {
} return int 70;
